                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='anthropic-sans,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system' fontsize='14'>&apos;Average profit margin falls from 25% on full-price orders to effectively 0% on orders discounted 21% or more — heavy discounting isn&apos;t just cutting into margin, it&apos;s erasing it entirely.&apos;</run>
